---
title: Buttermilk Pancakes
description: Fluffy weekend pancakes.
image: "[[Attachments/Recipes/buttermilk-pancakes.svg]]"
servings: 4
course: breakfast
prep time: 10 min
cook time: 20 min
tags: [breakfast, quick, vegetarian]
---
= Batter

Whisk @flour{250%g}, @sugar{2%tbsp}, @baking powder{2%tsp} and @salt{=1%pinch} in a #large bowl{}.

Beat @eggs{2} into @buttermilk{400%ml} with @butter{40%g}, melted, and stir it into the dry mix until just combined.

> Lumps are fine. Overmixing makes them tough.

Rest the batter for ~{10%minutes}.

= Cook

Heat a #frying pan{} over a medium heat and ladle in the batter. Cook for ~{2%minutes} until bubbles show, flip, and cook for ~{1%minute} more.

Serve with @maple syrup{4%tbsp} and @blueberries{150%g}.
